# `dfo::coopmads_blackbox_minimizer`

Minimises a black box in many variables with cooperative MADS, which optimises blocks of variables in turn.

## Signature

```cpp
dfo::BlackboxAdvancedOutcome dfo::coopmads_blackbox_minimizer(const std::function<dfo::BlackboxEvaluation(const pluss::Series &)> &blackbox, const pluss::Series &initial, const dfo::CoopMadsConfig &config = {});
template <class Fn> dfo::BlackboxAdvancedOutcome dfo::coopmads_blackbox_minimizer(Fn &&blackbox, const pluss::Series &initial, const dfo::CoopMadsConfig &config = {});
```

## What It Does

Plain MADS polls `2n` directions, so its cost per iteration grows with the number of variables. Cooperative MADS splits the variables into blocks of `subproblem_size`, runs MADS on one block at a time with the rest held at their current values, and repeats for `cooperative_rounds` rounds, reshuffling the blocks each round when `randomized_subproblems` is on. The evaluation budget of `base` is divided among all blocks and rounds. A final full-space run from the best point (a share `polish_fraction` of the budget) removes the error that coupling between blocks leaves. It suits separable or weakly coupled problems with many variables.

## Parameters

`Fn &&blackbox`
: A callable returning a `BlackboxEvaluation`, a `Series` of objectives or a number.

`const pluss::Series &initial`
: The starting point.

`const dfo::CoopMadsConfig &config`
: The settings.

## Returns

A [`BlackboxAdvancedOutcome`](BlackboxAdvancedOutcome.md).

## Errors

- A black box that returns neither objectives nor a failure flag throws on the first call.

## Practical Examples

### Example 1

Twenty-four variables of a separable quadratic.

@@run@@
```cpp
#include <pluss/ma.h>
#include <pluss/tils/kit/output.h>

#include <vector>

using namespace pluss::tils;

namespace dfo = pluss::subsp::math::optimization;
using pluss::Series;

int main() {
  OutputEngine out;
  out.print_defaults(PrintOptions{}.fixed(8));
  const auto black_box = [](const Series &x) {
    dfo::BlackboxEvaluation e;
    e.objectives = (x - 1.0).square().sum().reshape({1});
    return e;
  };
  dfo::CoopMadsConfig config;
  config.base.max_evaluations = 12000;
  config.subproblem_size = 6;
  const dfo::BlackboxAdvancedOutcome o = dfo::coopmads_blackbox_minimizer(black_box, pluss::series::make(std::vector<double>(24, -1.0)), config);
  out.writeln("minimum =", o.scalarized_minimum, ", evaluations =", o.diagnostics.evaluations, ", status =", dfo::to_string(o.status));
}
```

### Example 2

Plain MADS against cooperative MADS on the same budget.

@@run@@
```cpp
#include <pluss/ma.h>
#include <pluss/tils/kit/output.h>

#include <vector>

using namespace pluss::tils;

namespace dfo = pluss::subsp::math::optimization;
using pluss::Series;

int main() {
  OutputEngine out;
  out.print_defaults(PrintOptions{}.fixed(8));
  const auto black_box = [](const Series &x) {
    dfo::BlackboxEvaluation e;
    e.objectives = (x - 1.0).square().sum().reshape({1});
    return e;
  };
  const Series start = pluss::series::make(std::vector<double>(24, -1.0));
  dfo::MadsBlackboxAdvancedConfig plain;
  plain.max_evaluations = 12000;
  plain.max_iterations = 5000;
  dfo::CoopMadsConfig coop;
  coop.base = plain;
  coop.subproblem_size = 6;
  out.writeln("plain :", dfo::mads_blackbox_minimizer(black_box, start, plain).scalarized_minimum);
  out.writeln("coop  :", dfo::coopmads_blackbox_minimizer(black_box, start, coop).scalarized_minimum);
}
```

### Example 3

The polish. A share of the budget kept for a final full-space run.

@@run@@
```cpp
#include <pluss/ma.h>
#include <pluss/tils/kit/output.h>

#include <vector>

using namespace pluss::tils;

namespace dfo = pluss::subsp::math::optimization;
using pluss::Series;

int main() {
  OutputEngine out;
  out.print_defaults(PrintOptions{}.fixed(8));
  const auto black_box = [](const Series &x) {
    dfo::BlackboxEvaluation e;
    e.objectives = (x - 1.0).square().sum().reshape({1});
    return e;
  };
  for (const double polish : {0.0, 0.25}) {
    dfo::CoopMadsConfig config;
    config.base.max_evaluations = 8000;
    config.subproblem_size = 6;
    config.polish_fraction = polish;
    out.writeln("polish", polish, ": minimum =", dfo::coopmads_blackbox_minimizer(black_box, pluss::series::make(std::vector<double>(24, -1.0)), config).scalarized_minimum);
  }
}
```

